{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Hey! It's me, Makuta! Wanna know what this adventure is all about?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">My dream is to become the strongest! The best of myself! And to help me with that, my old man has hidden eight gems all around Stardust Island! Huh? You wanna know EXACTLY what you're in for? Sure, we'll have a lot of fun here with...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Character-driven stories. (no that's not my last name)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Linear chapter progresion. (but you can go back if ya missed anything)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turn-based combat. (i \u2764\ufe0f violence \u263a\ufe0f)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lots of options for battle. (there's no better fighting style than the one you like the best!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interesting Side Quests. (lots of hidden places to see when you help your friends)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Makuta Jumpscare (not featured in the actual game)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605010/extras/imnotsurewhattosayaboutthis.png?t=1745261501\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3605010?t=1745261501","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605010/05909cd1ea5f72a57767e6a504c10614dc846c44/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745261501","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605010/d34ed41153b9f1bc8337a0dc26f02970ebb46e9a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745261501","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605010/d34ed41153b9f1bc8337a0dc26f02970ebb46e9a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745261501",